      "content": "wait 15 mins of water feels like forever and it's making my face all wet and messy. i'm kinda scared to go to the hospital if it gets worse cuz it's so expensive and i'm alone right now. are you sure the water is enough? i have some aloe vera gel in the cabinet too, could that help coat the eye so the chemicals stop burning?",
