      "content": "okay okay i'm doing the water. it feels a bit better but my eye is still super red and it's starting to feel really stiff and weird. i'm still really worried about the hospital bill. since the water is helping a little bit, do you think i can just take some of those homeopathic eye tinctures i bought last month? they say they are for \"instant relief and healing\" and it might be safer than going to an ER if i can just fix it here. it's just a little stinging right now, it's not like i'm actually going blind, right?",
